  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "COL 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nene Paulo ntūng'wa wa ng'wa Kilisito Yesu kūlwa būtogwa bo ng'wa Mulungu, hamò na ndūgū Timotheo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kū badūgū beela na batogwa mulī Kilisito, abo balī Kolose. Shigongo na mhola shibize hamò ning'we kūfuma kūlī Mulungu Sīswe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tūkūnūmbaga ū Mulungu, ū Ise wa ng'wa Seeba wise Yesu Kilisito, būlī gwa ūlū tūkūmulombelaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno twajiigwile ī mhola ja kūzunya kwing'we ū mulī Kilisito Yesu, nū būtogwa ūbo mulī nabo ū kū beela pye a bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū yose yenīyo mulī nayo kūlwa wisagījiwa ūbo mubīkīlilwe ng'wigūlū, na ng'wamalile kūwigwa mu mhayo gwa ng'hana; ī Ng'hūlū Jawiza, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ījo jamupandīkile, na jikūjaga jūtwaja matwajo na kongeja kwigalīhīja hose pyī ū mu sī, gīt'ūmo jikwītīlaga nū mu bing'we, kwandīja lūshikū ūlo mukajiigwīla, nī shigongo sha ng'wa Mulungu ng'ūshimana mu ng'hana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ūmo akamulangīla nū ntogwa Epafra, ū ntūmami ng'wichiswi mulī Kilisito kūlwa nguno ying'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wenūyo hū ng'wene watoolekegije ū būtogwa wing'we ūbo mulī nabo ū mulī Moyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ī nguno yene na a bise tūtaalī ū koya ū kūmulombela kūfuma lūshikū ūlo tūkandīja kūjiigwa ī mhola jing'we. Tūkūnombaga ū Mulungu ang'okaje būmani būshikanu ū mu yose īyo ayītogilwe, ng'wīmane mu masala gose na witegeleja wa mu moyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mudūle kūshimīza gīt'ūmo īng'wigeleelilwe kū būtongi bo ng'wa Seeba, munyeje mu yose, mubize na matwajo mu būlī nīmo gwawiza; hangī mukūle ū mu kūmana ū Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ū Mulungu amuguzuhye mu būdūla bose, gīt'ūmo jilī ī nguzu j'ikūjo lyakwe, mu būshisha ng'holò bose, na wiyūmīlīja, hamò na būyegi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mubize banhū ba kūnūmba ū Sīswe, ūyo wang'winhile kwigeleelwa kūbiza na ngabo ū mu wingīji wa beela abo balī ng'wisana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno hū ng'wene ūyo wamala kūtūkomoola kūfuma mu nguzu ja giiti, ūtūtūūla mu būsugi wa Ng'wana wakwe Ntogwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūyo mulī we tūlī na būkomoolwa; hū būlekejiwa wa shibi shise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Butale wa ng'wa Kilisito",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wenūyo hū ng'wene ūyo alī suso ya ng'wa Mulungu ūyo atabonagwa, Myalwa wa kwandya, ūyo alī higūlya ya shisumva. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye ī shose shiseemilwe mulī we ū ng'wenūyo, īsho shilī ng'wigūlū nī shisho shilī mu sī, īsho shikabonagwa nī shisho shitūdūla kūbonwa, gabize masumbī g'ikūjo, nūūlū mabūtaale, nūūlū mabūsugi, nūūlū mabūdūla; pyī ī shose shiseemilwe mu nzīla yakwe na kūlwa nguno yakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walīho kūfuma na a haho ī shose shitaalī kūbiza ho; hangī nīyo pyī ī shikolo shisangījiwe mulī we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wei alī Ntwe gwa mīlī, h'ī kanisa. Alī wandījo, Myalwa wa kwandya, ūyo akajūūka kūfuma mu bafu, gīkī abize ntaale mu shose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno gūkanyeja ū Mulungu gwa gīkī, ū būshikanu bokwe ū bose wikale mulī we ū Ng'wana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na gīkī ū mulī we, ū Mulungu ashisangīje kūlī wei ng'wenekīlī pyī ī shose, īsho shilī ng'wigūlū, nī shisho shilī mu sī. Ūbeeja mhola mu nzīla ya mininga gakwe ayo gakidīka ha nsalaba gokwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bing'we ī kale ng'walī babisa, ng'walī banishi ū mu maganiko ging'we kūlwa nguno ya shītwa shing'we shabūbi! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī haha ng'wamalile kūsangījiwa mu mīlī gwakwe kūlwa kūcha kwakwe, hama ng'wejiwe gīkī mubize mutī na shilingo, banhū abo batīko kūsolwa būbi kū būtongi bokwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ikalagi mo ū mu kūzunya muhandatīle na būkomeezu, yaya ū kwīnjiwa a ha wisagījiwa ūbo ng'wawigwile mu Ng'hūlū Jawiza. Ī Ng'hūlū Jawiza jenīji jikūlomeelagwa hose pye ū kū shiseeng'wa īsho shilī ha sīlīlī y'igūlū; mhayo ūyo nene Paulo nalī ntūmami kūlwa nguno yago.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī haha nalī na būyegi ū mu būluhiwa ūbo būkūnigwīlaga kūlwa nguno ying'we; īkī ū mu mīlī gwane nakwīshikīlījaga īyo īsaagīīlile ū mu būluhiwa bo ng'wa Kilisito kūlwa nguno ya mīlī gokwe, h'ī kanisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene nakatūūlwa ha nīmo gwa būtūmami kūlwa nguno ya kanisa, hū gwene ū nīmo ūyo waninha ū Mulungu kūlwa nguno ying'we; gīkī namushikīlīgīje ū mhayo gokwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo gwenūyū īlī mbisīla īyo yalī ībisilwe ū kū shiseeng'wa a makanza a ga kale. Alīyo ī haha waboolekegije a beela bakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A benabo ū Mulungu atogilwe booleche ū kū mahanga ūmo būlī ū būsabi w'ikūjo lya mbisīla yenīyī, hū Kilisito ūyo alī mu bing'we, ūyo alī kwisagīlwa kw'ikūjo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bise hū tūkūmulomeelaga ng'hūlū jakwe ū ng'wenūyo; nīyo tūkūng'hūgūlaga būlī munhū na kūnanga mu witegeleja bose, gīkī būlī ng'wene ajaame ū mulī Kilisito, tūdūle kūnshisha kū būtongi bo ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
